./LOGBOOK.md:150:### 1454 — libssh2 adapter review rework closes async ownership gaps (TASK-260715-1ozsb6)
./LOGBOOK.md:151:- ROOT CAUSE: Actor isolation serialized synchronous libssh2 calls but not the socket service work awaited between `LIBSSH2_ERROR_EAGAIN` retries. Reentrant progress calls could snapshot the same outbound prefix, issue duplicate writes, and later remove inconsistent byte counts; suspended operations also retained channel/session pointers while teardown could free them.
