./LOGBOOK.md:164:### 0246 — SSH M0 viability keeps operational invariants and makes four evidence gaps typed
./LOGBOOK.md:165:- DECISION: ADR-023 is now exhaustive in `.spec/ssh-transport-conformance-contract.md` and `SSHConformanceRequirement`: 16 operational/security requirements are `m0ViabilityMandatory`; consumer-driven receive credit/cap, RFC channel-open rejection reasons, exact exec-exit presence/`coreDumped`, and deep server-KEX/keepalive observability are `m3Deferred(ownerTaskID: "TASK-260728-3cveay")`.
