./LOGBOOK.md:1070:- DECISION: iOS and macOS adapters share one locked `PacketFlowAdapterBoundary`; callback, task cancellation, and terminal adapter shutdown race for one continuation, while the callback registration remains a payload-free tombstone until NetworkExtension invokes it because `NEPacketTunnelFlow` exposes no deregistration API.
